{"ticker":{"symbol":"002710.KS","name":"TCC스틸","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":9740.0,"change_pct":-0.019133937562940573,"market_cap":255321391104.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.007186858316221766,"week52_low":6310.0,"week52_high":22950.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","country":"South Korea","city":"Pohang","employees":259,"website":"https://www.tccsteel.com","business_summary":"TCC Steel Corp. engages in the manufacture and sale of stone coated steel sheets, and other surface-treated steel sheets in South Korea, Asia, Europe, the Middle East, North America, and internationally. The company operates through three segments: Strategic Business Units, Surface Treated Steel Sheet, and Property for Rent segments. Its products include tinplate, tin free, nickel-plated, copper-plated, super tin, and laminated steel. The company was formerly known as Dongyang Tinplate Corp. and changed its name to TCC Steel Corp. in March 2003. TCC Steel Corp. was founded in 1959 and is headquartered in Pohang, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"TCC Steel Corp.은 한국, 아시아, 유럽, 중동, 북미 및 해외에서 석재 코팅 강판 및 기타 표면 처리 강판을 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 전략적 사업 단위, 표면 처리 강판 및 임대 자산 부문의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 해당 제품에는 주석판, 무주석, 니켈 도금, 구리 도금, 슈퍼 주석 및 적층 강철이 포함됩니다. 이 회사는 이전에 동양양철주식회사로 알려졌으나 2003년 3월에 TCC Steel Corp.로 상호를 변경했습니다. TCC Steel Corp.은 1959년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 포항에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"철강","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":684414631380.0,"operating_income":43995699210.0,"net_income":29343344550.0,"eps":1239.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":624418627120.0,"operating_income":11262766480.0,"net_income":-7752956650.0,"eps":-300.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":582074815370.0,"operating_income":12284472470.0,"net_income":20160837940.0,"eps":425.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":611513